  "notes": [
    "Community module (README: maintained by MiniFido) for the 16 microphone preamps of an Allen & Heath DT168 over the Dante primary network (UDP 8700/8702, multicast 224.0.0.231); it is published as beta (package.json version 1.0.0-beta.2).",
    "The input dropdown is built by channelOption() in src/channels.js:2 (ids 1..16) and is shared by all actions and the pad and phantom feedbacks. The pad and phantom actions are created by flagAction (src/actions.js:24) and share the state dropdown (src/actions.js:12-23).",
    "The gain is the analogue gain before the 20 dB pad: the action accepts 5 to 60 dB; the step is limited to -55..55 dB (src/actions.js:39-69).",
    "Not catalogued: variables and the 64 presets.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~2.1.3: expressions are supported for option values; the state dropdown documents the valid values in expressionDescription."
  ],
